<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts BICC.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman cuts BICC.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>BICC Plc was cut to &quot;neutral&quot; from &quot;outperform&quot; at Lehman Brothers, a research note from analyst Chris Hemingway at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>Hemingway said the stock was unattractive on the basis of its expected earnings for 1997 and was trading at a premium to its historic trading range.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
